        // LIST once rt_splitifs has split it, and it is by far the commonest
        // splittable word. There is no literal text for
        // a boundary delimiter to separate it from, so neither flag can change the answer
        // (a leading one finds nothing open, a trailing one closes the last field the word
        // would have closed anyway), and the acc/open assembly below can only rebuild what
